    <h2>Community</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="https://helsinki-python.github.io/">Helsinki Python</a> is a local Python user group in the Greater Helsinki region.</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.meetup.com/datatribe-meetup-group/">DataTribe</a> is a community for data professionals, engineers, analysts and anyone interested in data.</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.helsinkidataweek.fi/">Helsinki Data Week</a> is not only an annual week but a community that runs data meetups.</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/pyladies-tampere/">PyLadies Tampere</a> is a mentorship group focused on helping more women become active participants and leaders in the Python open-source community.</li>
        <li><a href="https://archipylago.dev/">Archipylago</a> is a community in Turku with meetups and sprints.</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.techtrib.es/">Techtribes</a> collects the tech meetups in Finland in one place.</li>
    </ul>

